A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular Japanese enka singer and voice actor known as '''[[wikipedia:Sachiko Kobayashi|Sachiko Kobayashi]]''' (小林 幸子, ''Kobayashi Sachiko'') was first held from April 28th, 2014 to May 16th, 2014. The collaboration includes exclusive stages going on during the collab period.

==Event Information==
A limited stage appears! Take on {{Color|#FF0000|'''Final Boss Strikes?!'''}} and unlock the mighty hero [[Cabaret Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF9900|'''Cabaret Cat'''}}]] upon victory!<br>
Then, challenge the extra-tough map {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cabaret Cat Awakens!'''}} and clear the stage for a chance to reveal Cabaret Cat's ultimate True Form!

During this event, visit the Legend/Event Stages section from The Battle Cats' title menu to access Final Boss Strikes?! and Cabaret Cat Awakens!<br>
Don't miss out your chance to acquire transcendent opulence!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from February 16th (12:00am) until February 16th (11:59pm)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Cabaret Cat must first be upgraded to level 20 or higher before it can be evolved to its True Form.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> You may still unlock access to Cabaret Cat's True Form by clearing Cabaret Cat Awakens! stages, even if you have not yet acquired the actual Cabaret Cat unit yet.

