==Trivia==
*This is the first collaboration event to happen with a real life person.
*In the [[The Battle Cats|English version]], the collaboration stages were once scheduled on January 31st, 2022. However, unlike other global versions, the schedule was removed one day before the event due to [[Let's GOOO!|Final Boss Strikes?!]] being mistranslated as "Lasvoss Strikes?!". The mapname was later fixed in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]].

